WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.006 --> 00:00:10.543
- MM, BROTHERS, BROTHERS,
BROTHERS,

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:15.014
SEE, WHEN ARE WE GON' THINK
OF OURSELVES AS MORE THAN THIS?

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:16.649
[chuckles]

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:18.785
WHAT Y'ALL DOING,
Y'ALL ROLLIN'? HUH?

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:19.885
[chuckles]

00:00:19.885 --> 00:00:21.788
FLIPPIN'? STOOPIN'?
[chuckles]

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:23.555
BOXIN'? MAXIN'?

00:00:23.555 --> 00:00:25.090
CHAXIN'?

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:27.393
I USED TO STOOP.
OH, YEAH.

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:29.728
I USED TO FLIP, ROLL, YOU KNOW,
WHATEVER YOU WANT TO CALL IT.

00:00:29.728 --> 00:00:31.898
[chuckles]
ME AND MY CREW,

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:36.503
WE WOULD GET INTO ACTIVITY,
MUCH LIKE YOURSELVES.

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:39.739
YOU SEE, THE PROBLEM WAS,
WE WERE ONLY PERPETUATING

00:00:39.739 --> 00:00:42.908
THE STEREOTYPE THE SYSTEM
ALREADY ASSUMES ABOUT US.

00:00:42.908 --> 00:00:45.811
MM.
YOU SEE, WE NEED TO

00:00:45.811 --> 00:00:49.081
STOP FEEDING INTO
THE PRECONCEIVED NOTIONS

00:00:49.081 --> 00:00:50.583
THAT WE ARE ALL--

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:54.187
- GREAT JOB, YOU GUYS.
YOU REALLY WORK HARD TODAY.

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:58.892
I WISH I COULD PAY YOU MORE,
BUT YOU KNOW HOW IT IS.

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:02.261
EH--WHO ARE YOU, HUH?
WHAT DO YOU WANT?

00:01:02.261 --> 00:01:05.831
- I-I DON'T KNOW.

00:01:05.831 --> 00:01:07.366
AS YOU WERE.

00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:09.468
- AS YOU WERE WHAT,
SMART GUY?

00:01:09.468 --> 00:01:12.372
[cursing in foreign language]

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:19.079
- MM. OH, HO.
BROTHERS, BROTHERS, BROTHERS,

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:22.549
LOOK AT YOURSELVES.
PANTS HANGIN' OFF YOUR ASS,

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:24.383
LOOKING LIKE
A COUPLE OF CLOWNS--

00:01:24.383 --> 00:01:28.254
WHICH YOU ARE. OKAY,
ENJOY THE BIRTHDAY CELEBRATION.

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:29.455
- GIMME YOUR [bleep] MONEY,
BITCH!

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:30.723
- NO! NO!
- I SAID,

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:33.126
GIMME YOUR [bleep] MONEY, BITCH!
- OH! OH!

00:01:33.126 --> 00:01:35.594
- [grunts]
- BROTHER, BROTHER, BROTHER.

00:01:35.594 --> 00:01:39.198
- SIR, EVERYBODY
IN THIS SELF-DEFENSE CLASS

00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:41.167
HAS ALREADY PAID
TO PARTICIPATE.

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:44.104
IF YOU'RE INTERESTED,
YOU CAN SIGN UP ONLINE.

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:47.373
- I'M INTERESTED.
- GOOD.

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:49.108
- THAT'S WHY I CAME OVER HERE.
I'M INTERESTED.

00:01:49.108 --> 00:01:50.476
I'M GON' THINK ABOUT IT.

00:01:50.476 --> 00:01:53.513
I'M INTERESTED.
- THANK YOU, SIR.

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:56.148
NOW, LADIES, IT'S GON' GET
REALLY INTENSE TODAY,

00:01:56.148 --> 00:01:57.449
NO MATTER WHAT HAPPENS.

00:01:57.449 --> 00:02:00.286
I WILL BE GROPING
YOUR BREASTASIES

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:02.121
AS IF YOU WERE BEING ATTACKED
LIKE A REAL ATTACKER.

00:02:02.121 --> 00:02:06.759
- BROTHER, BROTHER, MY BROTHER.
NOW, I WAS WATCHING YOU.

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:11.431
NOW, YOU OLDER BROTHERS
NEED TO BREAK THE STEREOTYPE

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:14.067
AND STOP BEING SO PREACHY.

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:15.301
- YOU KNOW WHAT?
- MM?

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:16.435
- I'M PREACHY?
- MM.

00:02:16.435 --> 00:02:17.803
- COME ON.
[scoffs]

00:02:17.803 --> 00:02:21.173
YOU PREACHY, MAN.
PLUS, YOU OLDER THAN ME.

00:02:21.173 --> 00:02:25.010
- I'M NINE YEARS OLD.
I GOT BENJAMIN BUTTON'S DISEASE.

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:29.015
- S--I'M DONE. I'M DONE.

